!web/public/luban-preview/**/*.mp3
# 2026-07-14 新增 4 包的 finished 是发布唯一源；源音频必须随 clean clone 可重建。
!artifacts/luban_case_family_assets/diagram_microlesson/finished/P40_B02/audio/**/*.mp3
